      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bunnlevel%2C_North_Carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The community incorporated as Bunnlevel in 1921 but has since been inactive as a municipality.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bunnlevel%2C_North_Carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Thorbiskope, a historic farmstead near Bunnlevel, was listed on the National Register of Historic Places in 1986.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
