      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bunnlevel%2C_North_Carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Bunnlevel sits on U.S. Route 401, just 7 miles south of Lillington and 20 miles north of Fayetteville.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
